<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51159" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĭtellĭus</span></b> , i,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the name of a Roman</i> gens. So esp., A. Vitellius, <i>a Roman emperor.</i>—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĭtellĭus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the emperor Vitellius</i>, <i>Vitellian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">via, so named after him,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vit. 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac.
				H. 1, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 57</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĭtellĭānus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Vitellius</i>, <i>Vitellian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">milites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					1, 85</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">partes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 84</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Dom. 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Capitol. Ver. 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vĭtellĭāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b>
			<i>Soldiers of Vitellius</i>, <i>Vitellians</i>, <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 3, 79</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Vesp. 8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>A kind of writing-tablets</i>, perh. <i>used by Vitellius</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 2, 6,
				6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 8,
			2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 9</span></i>
			<i>in lemm.</i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
